Temporarily reconcile the pinned ruyi-pytest submodule with the fix for
ruyisdk/ruyi#495: the default `ruyisdk` repository's priority is now persisted
in the `[repo]` section, so `ruyi repo set-priority ruyisdk <n>` succeeds
instead of failing with "no repo with id 'ruyisdk' found in user config".

This patch is applied by the CI integration test step and should be dropped
once the equivalent change lands in the ruyi-pytest repository and the
submodule pointer is bumped.

